                                               Table "public.resource_links"
       Column       |            Type             | Collation | Nullable |                     Default                     
--------------------+-----------------------------+-----------+----------+-------------------------------------------------
 link_id            | integer                     |           | not null | nextval('resource_links_link_id_seq'::regclass)
 parent_resource_id | integer                     |           | not null | 
 linked_resource_id | integer                     |           | not null | 
 relationship_type  | character varying(100)      |           | not null | 
 created_at         | timestamp without time zone |           |          | CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
 updated_at         | timestamp without time zone |           |          | CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
Indexes:
    "resource_links_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (link_id)
    "idx_resource_links_linked" btree (linked_resource_id)
    "idx_resource_links_parent" btree (parent_resource_id)
    "idx_resource_links_type" btree (relationship_type)
    "unique_resource_link" UNIQUE CONSTRAINT, btree (parent_resource_id, linked_resource_id)
Check constraints:
    "chk_different_resources" CHECK (parent_resource_id <> linked_resource_id)
Foreign-key constraints:
    "fk_resource_links_linked" FOREIGN KEY (linked_resource_id) REFERENCES resources(resource_id) ON DELETE CASCADE
    "fk_resource_links_parent" FOREIGN KEY (parent_resource_id) REFERENCES resources(resource_id) ON DELETE CASCADE
Triggers:
    resource_links_updated_at BEFORE UPDATE ON resource_links FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION update_updated_at_column()

